  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/09/IMG_0548.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(40 fotos) Un m&iacute;nimo de once m&uacute;sicos en cinco formaciones diferentes han participado la noche de este viernes en una jam session organizada por la cafeter&iacute;a Druida, de la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 de Onda, con interpretaciones de todos los estilos, aplaudidas a rabiar por el numeroso p&uacute;blico asistente.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jamsessiondruida160916/img_0494.jpg\" alt=\"img_0494\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jamsessiondruida160916/img_0496.jpg\" alt=\"img_0496\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jamsessiondruida160916/img_0499.jpg\" alt=\"img_0499\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jamsessiondruida160916/img_0500.jpg\" alt=\"img_0500\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jamsessiondruida160916/img_0501.jpg\" alt=\"img_0501\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jamsessiondruida160916/img_0502.jpg\" alt=\"img_0502\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jamsessiondruida160916/img_0503.jpg\" alt=\"img_0503\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jamsessiondruida160916/img_0504.jpg\" alt=\"img_0504\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfb